  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If the standard deviation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>9</mn></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>, then the standard deviation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>19</mn></math> is</p>\r"
  },
