  "solution": {
    "text": "Here, we see that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math> is added in each observation of the first data.<br /><br />Since we know that SD does not depend on change of origin.<br /><br />Hence, SD of second data is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>."
